#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php
msgid "Advanced Pixel for Barion"
msgstr "Barion Pixel für WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php
msgid "https://github.com/gcsecsey/advanced-pixel-for-barion"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php
msgid "Barion Pixel integration for WooCommerce with full e-commerce event tracking, cookie consent support, and WP Consent API compatibility."
msgstr "Barion Pixel-Integration für WooCommerce mit vollständigem E-Commerce-Event-Tracking, Cookie-Consent-Unterstützung und WP Consent API-Kompatibilität."

#. Author of the plugin
#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php
msgid "Gergely Csecsey"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php
msgid "https://github.com/gcsecsey"
msgstr ""

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:133
msgid "Barion Pixel Settings"
msgstr "Barion Pixel-Einstellungen"

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:134
msgid "Barion Pixel"
msgstr "Barion Pixel"

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:151
msgid "Barion Pixel Configuration"
msgstr "Barion Pixel-Konfiguration"

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:158
msgid "Pixel ID"
msgstr "Pixel-ID"

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:166
msgid "Enable Full Pixel Tracking"
msgstr "Vollständiges Pixel-Tracking aktivieren"

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:174
msgid "Debug Mode"
msgstr "Debug-Modus"

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:226
msgid "Configure your Barion Pixel integration. The Base Pixel will be loaded on all pages when a Pixel ID is provided. Full tracking includes e-commerce events like product views, add to cart, checkout, and purchase."
msgstr "Konfiguriere deine Barion Pixel-Integration. Das Basis-Pixel wird auf allen Seiten geladen, wenn eine Pixel-ID angegeben ist. Vollständiges Tracking umfasst E-Commerce-Ereignisse wie Produktansichten, Warenkorb, Kasse und Kauf."

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:233
msgid "The WP Consent API plugin is not active. Consent is still forwarded automatically for CookieYes, Complianz, Cookiebot and Cookie Law Info."
msgstr "Das Plugin WP Consent API ist nicht aktiv. Die Einwilligung wird trotzdem automatisch für CookieYes, Complianz, Cookiebot und Cookie Law Info weitergegeben."

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:235
msgid "With any other cookie banner you must call window.wcBarionGrantConsent() yourself. Barion does not approve a Full Pixel integration that never sends grantConsent."
msgstr "Bei jedem anderen Cookie-Banner musst du window.wcBarionGrantConsent() selbst aufrufen. Barion genehmigt keine Full-Pixel-Integration, die niemals grantConsent sendet."

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:237
msgid "Install the WP Consent API plugin"
msgstr "Plugin WP Consent API installieren"

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:243
msgid "The Barion Payment Gateway plugin also has a Pixel ID configured. Both plugins will work correctly together — the base pixel script will only be loaded once. You may remove the Pixel ID from the payment gateway settings to keep configuration in one place."
msgstr "Das Barion Payment Gateway-Plugin hat ebenfalls eine Pixel-ID konfiguriert. Beide Plugins funktionieren korrekt zusammen — das Basis-Pixel-Skript wird nur einmal geladen. Du kannst die Pixel-ID aus den Zahlungs-Gateway-Einstellungen entfernen, um die Konfiguration an einem Ort zu bündeln."

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:261
msgid "Enter your Barion Pixel ID (e.g., BP-0000000000-00)"
msgstr "Gib deine Barion Pixel-ID ein (z. B. BP-0000000000-00)"

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:278
msgid "Enable full Barion Pixel event tracking (contentView, addToCart, initiateCheckout, purchase)"
msgstr "Vollständiges Barion Pixel-Event-Tracking aktivieren (contentView, addToCart, initiateCheckout, purchase)"

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:280
msgid "Base Pixel script will always be loaded. Enable this to track e-commerce events."
msgstr "Das Basis-Pixel-Skript wird immer geladen. Aktiviere diese Option, um E-Commerce-Ereignisse zu verfolgen."

#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:297
msgid "Enable debug mode (logs events to browser console)"
msgstr "Debug-Modus aktivieren (protokolliert Ereignisse in der Browser-Konsole)"
